# Repo boundary

This workspace is GitHub [`Tilo-Syntiv/Filter-Hero-OFFICIAL`](https://github.com/Tilo-Syntiv/Filter-Hero-OFFICIAL). It is the shop for `https://filterhero.net`.

[`Tilo-Syntiv/FILTER-HERO`](https://github.com/Tilo-Syntiv/FILTER-HERO) is a different GitHub project. It has its own history, branches, and commits. Work in this checkout stays here.

- Push, pull, and deploy only `Filter-Hero-OFFICIAL`. Remote name is `origin`.
- Leave `FILTER-HERO` alone. Do not add it back as a remote, upstream, or Railway source.
- Production GitHub source is `Filter-Hero-OFFICIAL` `main` (FH-351). The Railway **service** is still named `FILTER-HERO`. That name is the host, not the GitHub project.
- [`Tilo-Syntiv/filter-hero-pro`](https://github.com/Tilo-Syntiv/filter-hero-pro) is the investor-deck repo. Deck edits belong there. Shop edits belong here.
